# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supertherm site: build environment
# Copy to `.env` for local builds, and set the same variable in
# Cloudflare Pages -> Settings -> Variables and secrets (build).
# The site builds fine WITHOUT it (it then uses the content in src/data/site.ts).
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# Where the build reads published content from: the address of the deployed
# site itself (its /api/content endpoint). No trailing slash.
# Leave empty to build from src/data/site.ts only.
PUBLIC_CMS_URL=https://www.superthermcorporations.com

# Contact form: the "Send enquiry" button composes a WhatsApp message to the
# company number (company.phone); no extra config needed.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT set here: the content console's backend settings live in Cloudflare.
#   Bindings (wrangler.toml):  DB (D1 database), MEDIA (R2 bucket, optional)
#   Secret:                    DEPLOY_HOOK_URL
#       npx wrangler pages secret put DEPLOY_HOOK_URL
#   For local testing only, put DEPLOY_HOOK_URL=... in `.dev.vars` (git-ignored).
# There are no API keys in the browser: sign-in uses an HttpOnly session cookie.
# See docs/CMS-SETUP.md.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
